/* ---------- 涓婁笅鏂囨诞绐楋紙瀵归綈 iOS popover锛氶敋瀹氱幆鎸夐挳涓婃柟锛屽甫灏忕澶达級 ---------- */
.ctx-pop-mask {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 80;
  background: transparent;
}
.ctx-pop {
  position: absolute;
  right: 0;
  bottom: calc(100% + 14rpx);
  width: min(600rpx, calc(100vw - 56rpx));
  box-sizing: border-box;
  z-index: 81;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--float-shadow);
  padding: 32rpx;
}
/* 鎸囧悜鐜寜閽殑灏忕澶达細涓績瀵瑰噯涓婁笅鏂囧渾鐜浘鏍?
   灞忓箷鍙充晶 鈫?鍦嗙幆涓績 = dock 28 + composer 28 + 鍙戦€侀敭 84 + 闂磋窛 14 + 鐜?margin 16 + 鐜崐寰?22 = 192rpx
   寮圭獥 right 28 + 绠ご right + 绠ご鍗婂 10 = 192 鈫?绠ご right = 154rpx */
.ctx-pop::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  right: 28rpx;
  bottom: -11rpx;
  width: 20rpx;
  height: 20rpx;
  background: var(--surface);
  border-right: 1rpx solid var(--border);
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--border);
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}
/* 寰呭彂鏂囦欢鏉＄洰锛? 鈫?鏂囦欢锛?*/
.pending-file {
